  "title": "Legance announces adoption of Legora across all practice areas",
  "summary": "Legance, one of Italy's leading independent law firms, has rolled out Legora to all of its professionals firm-wide. The deployment follows a three-month implementation that is the first of its kind in the Italian market, both in process and in scale, integrating Legora directly into how Legance's lawyers already work.",
